2026-08-19T03:55:57.1579150Z [36;1m# CI installs, so the wrapper is still doing real work here. It stays[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1579565Z [36;1m# after that too: it costs nothing and is correct either way.[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1579886Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1580203Z [36;1m# Windows deliberately keeps the plain prefix, as a control group: it is[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1580912Z [36;1m# where a repeat of that upstream change would show up, while the Unix[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1581290Z [36;1m# jobs carry on regardless.[0m
