2026-08-19T03:55:57.1598712Z [36;1m# Compile on every core the runner has, not the two this used to pin.[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1599179Z [36;1m# Standard GitHub-hosted Linux runners have been 4-vCPU since 2024, so[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1599640Z [36;1m# -j2 left half the box idle through the phase that dominates a build:[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1600081Z [36;1m# measured on a 4-core box, 8 vendored unity objects with ccache[0m
