2026-08-19T03:55:57.1627142Z [36;1m# Do NOT export UserNM here, however tempting the `UserNM=true` trick[0m
2026-08-19T03:55:57.1627601Z [36;1m# from AGENTS.md looks. It is a development shortcut, not a CI setting.[0m
